+# Knowledge boundary rollback
+
+The boundary extraction is a read-path change only. If it must be rolled back,
+restore `DocumentsController#index` to its previous rendering expression and
+remove the focused boundary regression test. No schema, table, record, or
+persistence conversion is part of this change, so rollback does not require a
+data migration or a data repair.
+
+The `Knowledge::Catalog.list(tenant_id:)` API may remain available to callers
+such as retrieval even if the HTTP delivery path is temporarily reverted.
